        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Archives</strong> is a psychological horror experience where space, memory, and reality quietly unravel around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken inside a circular hall, surrounded by twelve identical corridors. Only one of them is real.<br>The others are lies — or traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct path reshapes the world.<br>New objects appear in the hall.<br>Documents emerge, whispering about experiments, about a captured seraph… and about a forbidden name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every wrong turn resets everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906130/extras/6e62e908bb6636f4146a9fe0137f6c57.poster.avif?t=1763710203\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906130/extras/6e62e908bb6636f4146a9fe0137f6c57.webm?t=1763710203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906130/extras/6e62e908bb6636f4146a9fe0137f6c57.mp4?t=1763710203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No monsters are chasing you.<br>No combat.<br>Only silence, distorted space, and the subtle anomalies that reveal which corridor is true — and which ones exist only to deceive you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only safe path is the one untouched by corruption.<br>The one that feels <i>normal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the hall transforms.<br>The archive grows.<br>A dome forms at the center.<br>And inside it… something waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An angel, broken and bound.<br>Tortured for a single purpose: <strong>to reveal a name</strong>.<br>A name no one should ever hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ Immersive first-person exploration — move through twisting corridors, hidden alcoves, and endless hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <strong>Subtle anomalies</strong> — shadows, flickers, misplaced objects, spatial inconsistencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Evolving central hall</strong> — each correct choice adds a new object, unveiling more of the hidden archive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Minimalist but heavy atmosphere</strong> — sound design and environmental storytelling carry the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕰️ Looped, shifting environment — return to places altered subtly, forcing careful attention and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
