ph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕯️ Immersive first-person exploration — move through twisting corridors, hidden alcoves, and endless hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔍 <strong>Subtle anomalies</strong> — shadows, flickers, misplaced objects, spatial inconsistencies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Evolving central hall</strong> — each correct choice adds a new object, unveiling more of the hidden archive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Minimalist but heavy atmosphere</strong> — sound design and environmental storytelling carry the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕰️ Looped, shifting environment — return to places altered subtly, forcing careful attention and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
